select 'dhruv-north','Dhruv North','YG-DHR-SL-BL',(select id from collections where slug='dhruv'),'The seven sages point north. So do we.','Silver tonneau case, blue silicone strap and an embossed navy compass dial, powered by Japanese quartz.','A polished and brushed silver case, 44 × 52 mm, frames the navy dial. The compass rose and star markers are raised in gold, and the blue silicone strap flows out of the case in one smooth line. Bright in daylight and sharp at night, it runs on a Japanese quartz movement and carries a 1-year warranty.','["Embossed navy dial with raised gold detail", "Japanese quartz movement", "Silver tonneau case, Blue silicone strap", "44 × 52 mm, 15 mm thick", "1-year warranty"]'::jsonb,'Silver','Blue',85,5999,9999,50,0,0,false,'{"Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Silver, tonneau, 44 × 52 mm, 17 mm thick", "Strap": "Blue silicone", "Dial": "Embossed navy dial", "Weight": "Approx. 85 g", "Warranty": "1 year"}'::jsonb,2,'Dhruv North | YUGASTRA Dhruv Collection','Silver tonneau case, blue silicone strap and an embossed navy compass dial, powered by Japanese quartz. Japanese quartz, silicone strap, 1-year warranty. ₹5,999.'
on conflict (slug) do nothing;
