select 'surya-eclipse','Surya Eclipse','YG-SUR-BK-BK',(select id from collections where slug='surya'),'The sun in shadow, still twelve rays.','Black tonneau case, black silicone strap and an embossed gold sun on a black dial, powered by Japanese quartz.','Black on black, with only the gold sun standing out. Twelve raised rays of alternating straight and wavy form catch the light as the watch moves. The 44 × 52 mm case is thick and solid, and the silicone strap is soft and flexible. Japanese quartz movement keeps accurate time, with a 1-year warranty.','["Embossed black dial with raised gold detail", "Japanese quartz movement", "Black tonneau case, Black silicone strap", "44 × 52 mm, 15 mm thick", "1-year warranty"]'::jsonb,'Black','Black',85,5999,9999,50,0,0,true,'{"Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Black, tonneau, 44 × 52 mm, 17 mm thick", "Strap": "Black silicone", "Dial": "Embossed black dial", "Weight": "Approx. 85 g", "Warranty": "1 year"}'::jsonb,4,'Surya Eclipse | YUGASTRA Surya Collection','Black tonneau case, black silicone strap and an embossed gold sun on a black dial, powered by Japanese quartz. Japanese quartz, silicone strap, 1-year warranty. ₹5,999.'
