select 'vyom-emerald','Vyom Emerald','YG-VYO-GD-GN',(select id from collections where slug='vyom'),'The sky, in emerald and gold.','Gold tonneau case, green silicone strap and an embossed dark green cosmos dial, powered by Japanese quartz.','Gold and green together, from the case to the strap. The dial has three embossed orbit rings, a striated gold sphere and nine beads, with sixty fine minute ticks around the edge. 44 × 52 mm, Japanese quartz movement, 1-year warranty.','["Embossed dark green dial with raised gold detail", "Japanese quartz movement", "Gold tonneau case, Green silicone strap", "44 × 52 mm, 15 mm thick", "1-year warranty"]'::jsonb,'Gold','Green',85,5999,9999,50,0,0,false,'{"Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Gold, tonneau, 44 × 52 mm, 17 mm thick", "Strap": "Green silicone", "Dial": "Embossed dark green dial", "Weight": "Approx. 85 g", "Warranty": "1 year"}'::jsonb,16,'Vyom Emerald | YUGASTRA Vyom Collection','Gold tonneau case, green silicone strap and an embossed dark green cosmos dial, powered by Japanese quartz. Japanese quartz, silicone strap, 1-year warranty. ₹5,999.'
