('Introducing','Yugastra','Time, written in the sky. Five dials drawn from the Vedic cosmos, in Japanese quartz.','Shop the collections','/collections','dhruv',1),
('Dhruv collection','Dhruv','Stay true to your direction. The pole star never moves. Our navy compass dial points the way.','Explore Dhruv','/collections/dhruv','dhruv',2),
