('Naksh collection','Naksh','Some things are written. Twenty-seven embossed stars on deep maroon, one for each night of the moon''s path.','Explore Naksh','/collections/naksh','naksh',4),
('Vyom collection','Vyom','Keep looking up. Nine bodies, three orbits and a sphere, in gold on dark green.','Explore Vyom','/collections/vyom','vyom',5),
('Soma collection','Soma','Calm, in cycles. Thirty lunar days around a silver crescent, on moonlit graphite.','Explore Soma','/collections/soma','soma',6);

