update products set tagline='A silver crescent, thirty nights.',description='Silver case, black strap, graphite dial. Silver case, black strap, an embossed graphite dial with a silver crescent. Japanese quartz.',long_description='Silver case, black strap, graphite dial. The moon in its simplest form, with fifteen bright dots and fifteen dark for its waxing and waning. A polished silver tonneau case, 44 × 52 mm and 17 mm deep, bright as moonlight on water. The black silicone strap is soft, light and moulded to sit flush against the case. Within is an accurate Japanese quartz movement. Soma Crescent belongs to Soma, one realm of the Yugastra sky: a timeless piece, made to be kept and not replaced.',features='["Embossed graphite dial with a silver crescent", "Japanese quartz movement", "Silver tonneau case, Black silicone strap", "44 × 52 mm, 17 mm deep", "1-year warranty"]'::jsonb,specs='{"Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Silver, tonneau, 44 × 52 mm, 17 mm deep", "Strap": "Black silicone", "Dial": "Embossed graphite dial", "Weight": "Approx. 85 g", "Warranty": "1 year"}'::jsonb,seo_title='Soma Crescent · Soma Collection | YUGASTRA',seo_description='A silver crescent, thirty nights. Soma Crescent: silver case, black strap, an embossed graphite dial with a silver crescent. Japanese quartz, 1-year warranty. From YUGASTRA, the weapon of timelessness. ₹5,999.' where slug='soma-crescent';
